count/avatar/00/22/80/24/b2a60008.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1634804891,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":116266,"content":"您说的这种情况，只要放到库存的流量是安全的，对数据库来说是没有问题的。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"王张飞","uid":2254827,"ctime":1636425652,"ip_address":"","comment_id":317466,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":4,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"有没有考虑过一个问题。如果中途活动进行时，库存被修改过。原先是30件。现在改成10件。如果缓存没有及时同步过去，数据库10件，缓存30件。这时候。请求还是要过到库存上。该加的行锁还是要加。","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2254827,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/22/67/eb/68370b09.jpg","nickname":"王张飞","note":"","ucode":"A59979CC4B684A","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":528827,"discussion_content":"您说的这种情况，只要放到库存的流量是安全的，对数据库来说是没有问题的。","content_length":35,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1636425652,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1105126,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/dc/e6/cfb409ab.jpg","nickname":"intomymind","note":"","ucode":"B954C9BFEC8667","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":535722,"discussion_content":"1、扣减库存是在redis上进行扣减的吗，也就是只有在redis上扣减成功了就说明秒杀商品成功了，那么之后怎么同步到mysql呢\n2、这位同学也说了一种场景，就是redis和库存和mysql的库存不一样，按照作者回答的意思，在redis上扣减成功了还需要同步到mysql?","content_length":136,"likes_number":2,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1638524054,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1883737,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/be/59/d890189f.jpg","nickname":"小猫","note":"","ucode":"615CF321850403","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1105126,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/dc/e6/cfb409ab.jpg","nickname":"intomymind","note":"","ucode":"B954C9BFEC8667","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":682877,"discussion_content":"可以使用预扣库存 + 消息队列的形式去完成下单。预扣库存成功后，将订单信息推到MQ，有专门的MQ消费者去生成订单。一般订单生成后不会立刻付款，会给个10分钟的限制。只有真正付款的时候才会去mysql修改库存。付款的时候再校验一下库存够不够就完事了，就算redis、mysql不同步也没关系。其实只要前后端配合好，redis、mysql数据有点出入没关系，redis拦掉99.99%不进业务流程就行。","content_length":507,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1774798020,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":535722,"ip_address":"江苏","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":682877,"extra":""}]},{"author":{"id":1015938,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/82/3c21b30c.jpg","nickname":"梅子黄时雨","note":"","ucode":"9F788D09C2E9E7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":594777,"discussion_content":"其实这里，我感觉还少了一个步骤，就是redis扣减库存成功，要推送一条消息，给到订单服务，去完成正常的下单。这两个操作可以使用rocketmq的事务消息绑定再一起。","content_length":82,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1669368694,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":318202,"user_name":"清风","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1542078,"ip_address":"","ucode":"AB2D169746BC23","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/87/be/7466bf26.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1635203989,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":116250,"content":"您说的情况是可能存在的，大部分前置的本地库存都会比数据库或redis要延时，所以要视自身业务和系统资源情况做取舍。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"王张飞","uid":2254827,"ctime":1636422578,"ip_address":"","comment_id":318202,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"前置检验应该不太好。如果前置检验，后面的过程中有可能库存就发生变化了，最后可能造成下单失败","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2254827,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/22/67/eb/68370b09.jpg","nickname":"王张飞","note":"","ucode":"A59979CC4B684A","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":529137,"discussion_content":"您说的情况是可能存在的，大部分前置的本地库存都会比数据库或redis要延时，所以要视自身业务和系统资源情况做取舍。","content_length":57,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1636422578,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":316716,"user_name":"小五","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1411419,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B7B1F121837CD9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/89/5b/b014ce14.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1634523852,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":116258,"content":"这里解答一下您的疑问：\n1.削峰和限流的目的其实就是在了解系统能力之后所做的保护措施，所以一般放过去的流量都是系统所能承受的，redis单片操作有上限，对于写操作，如果想硬抗流量只能通过拆key到不同分片的方式，但这种会带来新的问题\n2.是的\n3.是的，整个秒杀系统，流量较高的链路，都不建议使用锁，会带来新问题","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"王张飞","uid":2254827,"ctime":1636423689,"ip_address":"","comment_id":316716,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"1 秒杀流量经过之前的削峰和限流后，到达限购系统的流量是不是不会很多？如果很多的话，如使用 Redis 做库存限购的话有上限问题吧，不过采用分片好像可以解决。\n2 限购后，把适应库存的流量打到库存系统，使用行锁做兜底，就不会超卖了吧？\n3 老师提到 “通过分布式锁的方式可以实现，但不建议使用。“ 这个操作是在类似削峰、限购后的逻辑吧？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":2254827,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/22/67/eb/68370b09.jpg","nickname":"王张飞","note":"","ucode":"A59979CC4B684A","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":528470,"discussion_content":"这里解答一下您的疑问：\n1.削峰和限流的目的其实就是在了解系统能力之后所做的保护措施，所以一般放过去的流量都是系统所能承受的，redis单片操作有上限，对于写操作，如果想硬抗流量只能通过拆key到不同分片的方式，但这种会带来新的问题\n2.是的\n3.是的，整个秒杀系统，流量较高的链路，都不建议使用锁，会带来新问题","content_length":156,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1636423689,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1183171,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/0d/c3/585cf657.jpg","nickname":"行者","note":"","ucode":"AA89537CE3A191","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":406364,"discussion_content":"请教一下，如果使用了分片，在如果一个订单扣减库存的时候需要多个分片才能满足的解决思路是什么？","content_length":46,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1634741680,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":1,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1015938,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/82/3c21b30c.jpg","nickname":"梅子黄时雨","note":"","ucode":"9F788D09C2E9E7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1183171,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/0d/c3/585cf657.jpg","nickname":"行者","note":"","ucode":"AA89537CE3A191","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":594770,"discussion_content":"一个分片一个分片扣嘛。","content_length":11,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1669362704,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":406364,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":594770,"extra":""}]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":332506,"user_name":"Geek2014","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2028957,"ip_address":"","ucode":"9EB356D8DF287E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/f5/9d/104bb8ea.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1643280190,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":" 老实说这一章讲解库存方案很初级，如果像回答其他人所说的限流之后都是安全流量，那么给定初始库存值、直接调用原子增减函数就可以了。为什么不调研一下同行如何做的呢？比方说阿里巴巴、小米电商的库存如何实现的。","like_count":18,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1122174,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/1f/7e/f1d369e6.jpg","nickname":"幽灵","note":"","ucode":"5FDBBFC74B2C1A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":587090,"discussion_content":"的确 原子扣减就行，","content_length":10,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1662781241,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"湖北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":373484,"user_name":"寒溪","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1001970,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"67B9F1A1C15A20","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/49/f2/25cfa472.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1682563323,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"这个方案有点儿自我YY，最好提供方案对比，比如竞对是怎么做的","like_count":7},{"had_liked":false,"id":326576,"user_name":"疯子","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1370542,"ip_address":"","ucode":"0072C5AD63888A","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1639569204,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"老师 redis和mysql数据怎么同步怎么没说呢， redis 不支持事物， mysql数据回滚 redis数据怎么处理？而且redis扣减扣减成功之后 不一定都会到mysql里面去吧","like_count":6,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1173897,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/e9/89/9fdd967c.jpg","nickname":"晴天","note":"","ucode":"335EF74F1357E4","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":546508,"discussion_content":"我的理解：秒杀场景下的库存就放到 redis 存储了。在秒杀的过程中不用考虑 redis 与 mysql 的交互。","content_length":57,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1642327728,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1015938,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/82/3c21b30c.jpg","nickname":"梅子黄时雨","note":"","ucode":"9F788D09C2E9E7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":594780,"discussion_content":"单单就秒杀系统来说，库存是放到redis中的，扣减完这里的就好了。不过，还不完整，业务上还应该在扣减REDIS库存成功后，推送一条消息给到订单服务来完成正常的生单操作。","content_length":84,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1669369736,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":323589,"user_name":"xben","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1248046,"ip_address":"","ucode":"E570E5E31F416C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/0b/2e/c324a7de.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1638007046,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"活动库存在redis中扣减完之后，需要是否同步扣减数据库一致性如何保证呢？亦或者 不同步扣减数据库，在redis扣减完成之后，web-server宕机-此次扣减库存的操作也无法回溯呢？这个问题怎么解","like_count":5,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1015938,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/82/3c21b30c.jpg","nickname":"梅子黄时雨","note":"","ucode":"9F788D09C2E9E7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":594778,"discussion_content":"其实从业务上来讲，扣减完库存后，就要生成订单了。这里也是一样，redis里扣减完库存后，还要推送一条消息给订单服务去生成订单，在生单的逻辑中，已经有库存扣减的逻辑了，到这里就完成了redis扣减与mysql数据的一致性，当然是最终一致性了。","content_length":120,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1669369496,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":1122174,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/1f/7e/f1d369e6.jpg","nickname":"幽灵","note":"","ucode":"5FDBBFC74B2C1A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":587091,"discussion_content":"有解决方案吗","content_length":6,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1662781268,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"湖北","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":2573275,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/27/43/db/8066d312.jpg","nickname":"闲聊","note":"","ucode":"C38A96DB40F879","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":536862,"discussion_content":"如果同步就没性能优势了吧，就是串行操作而已，感觉最后的优化就是把db操作转化内存串行操作","content_length":44,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1638882794,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":354746,"user_name":"陈浪","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1832787,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"DB52EF0A5D54B1","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTKb9HTrTjNMicEHX1M6PCfAnKw8ibcVFT0eicc0NzKWibHG3sCQc3zJSicmibeg0tzJck9F69Llk99gibOdA/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1660740858,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"如果redis一个主节点挂了，从节点升主，是不是也会超卖？","like_count":3,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1015938,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/82/3c21b30c.jpg","nickname":"梅子黄时雨","note":"","ucode":"9F788D09C2E9E7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":594769,"discussion_content":"有这种可能，主从之间是异步复制的，在没有复制完成时，主节点就宕机了。其实这是个CAP的选择问题，选择主从就会有数据一致性问题。所以，大胆一点，选择CP，直接放弃主从。","content_length":83,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1669362484,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":351796,"user_name":"saltedfish","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1946257,"ip_address":"","ucode":"936571E1AC4139","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/b2/91/cf0de36e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1658199150,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"这只是提出了一个可行的方案，各种异常处理都不提的吗？比如redis的可用性，相关降级方案之类的","like_count":3},{"had_liked":false,"id":374153,"user_name":"李雪楠","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":3235014,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"0E905BCFEFAD4A","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1683645219,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"老师有个疑问请教下。在扣减库存时候的流量属于是安全流量。并且已经过滤了一部分了。但是如果此时的流量还是很大呢。比如我们上边的限购系统或者预约系统放过来的流量还是很多。redis但分片也就是大几万的qps。此时要怎么解决呢（前面的文章说了不推荐将流量分散到其他分片上）？","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":362841,"user_name":"reallife","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2382796,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"DF87131E16648F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/5b/cc/f33e47ad.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1668955385,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"老师这个集群环境一个订单里面多个商品。不同的商品Id可能在不同的分片上。lua脚本不支持跨分片执行吧。这种问题要如何解决呢？让他在一个分片上集群又失去了意义。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1015938,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/80/82/3c21b30c.jpg","nickname":"梅子黄时雨","note":"","ucode":"9F788D09C2E9E7","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":594768,"discussion_content":"一般秒杀场景的话，一个订单就一个商品，单个lua是不能跨分片，可以for遍历分片嘛","content_length":41,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1669362251,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":341123,"user_name":"宋","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1339736,"ip_address":"","ucode":"317516E4951944","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/71/58/b171d14e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1649380313,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"前置是需要的，正常情况秒杀商品很快就没库存了不需要打到后端。","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1173894,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/e9/86/d34800a4.jpg","nickname":"darron","note":"","ucode":"92EF9EF1B1B1B3","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":636649,"discussion_content":"前置了不是更加容易出现数据一致性问题么？有真实案例么","content_length":26,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1706637598,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":329451,"user_name":"Muscleape","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1124083,"ip_address":"","ucode":"FCD7641E1DD709","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/26/f3/cd8eea0b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1641353485,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"代码中只有Redis控制库存扣减的操作，对于要用户取消或没有支付等终止购买的行为，没有Redis库存回填的操作，是库存回填这里没有什么需要说明的吗，还是其他的方式做了这个操作？","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1173897,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/e9/89/9fdd967c.jpg","nickname":"晴天","note":"","ucode":"335EF74F1357E4","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":546509,"discussion_content":"库存回滚和扣减一个道理吧","content_length":12,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1642327810,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":389873,"user_name":"Geek_3b4ae8","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2044544,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"D590CE490249D4","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1713749159,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"这和直接用incr命令减没有区别啊，减完在代码里判断一下是否小于0不就行了。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":386178,"user_name":"文敦复","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1195258,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"B8F4A6BD5D7805","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/3c/fa/e2990931.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1704270025,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"分享个改进的lua脚本：\n```\n-- 查询活动库存\nlocal stock = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;get&#39;, KEYS[1]))\nlocal quantity = tonumber(ARGV[1])\n\n-- 检查库存和数量是否有效\nif not stock or not quantity or stock &lt; quantity then\n   return 0\nend\n\n-- 执行库存扣减\nredis.call(&#39;decrby&#39;, KEYS[1], quantity)\nreturn 1 -- 返回成功标识\n```\n\n1. 扣减库存放ARG中，KEY中就是存在的键值。\n2. 命名优化，逻辑更清晰。\n3. 返回值明确：返回的1表示成功，0表示失败","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":351797,"user_name":"saltedfish","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1946257,"ip_address":"","ucode":"936571E1AC4139","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/b2/91/cf0de36e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1658199293,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"如果获取库存成功，但是后续流程（比如下单、支付）失败了怎么办？incrby？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":351124,"user_name":"菠萝power","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1132050,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8B3DA9859187C5","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/46/12/965a6cc9.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1657535205,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"Important: to ensure the correct execution of scripts, both in standalone and clustered deployments, all names of keys that a script accesses must be explicitly provided as input key arguments.\n用户请求数应该放到 ARG 里更好吧，放 KEY 里和 EVAL 命令的语义相悖","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":321899,"user_name":"吕","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1210890,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8F08E2CB81C4C3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/7a/0a/0ce5c232.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1637106746,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100091501,"comment_content":"老师，我有个疑问，使用redis和lua控制库存超卖后，那这里需要保证mysql和redis中的库存一致性么是？如果需要保证一致性，如果redis减完库存，如果不加锁，那么mysql还是会出现库存超卖啊，这里应该怎么实现？还有redis在减库存的前后，是不是还要做一个记录日志同步到mysql数据库中，来避免redis出现问题，能够进行库存的历史数据追踪？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1934802,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/85/d2/045c63fb.jpg","nickname":"王建新","note":"","ucode":"E3151DDC0EEF0D","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":551707,"discussion_content":"只用redis，不用mysql，秒杀完了之后同步db。","content_length":27,"likes_number":1,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1645091859,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent